so D3D12 and Metal for SPIR-V.\r\nOur last sync was almost 2 years ago so this is long overdue, and thus would be good to include in 4.6.\r\n\r\nUpdated:\r\n- vulkan headers\r\n- volk\r\n- glslang\r\n- spirv-headers\r\n- spirv-cross\r\n- spirv-reflect\r\n- vk_mem_alloc 3.3.0\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] SPIRV-Reflect not updated yet as they implemented support for specialization constants which conflicts with our patches, so this needs some work to use the new upstream API if suitable.\r\n@DarioSamo Would you be able to take a look at doing the SPIRV-Reflect update as a PR/direct push to my branch?\r\n*Edit:* Done, thanks Darío!\r\n- [x] VulkanMemoryAllocator not updated as it's not versioned together with the SDK, and it often requires more work.\r\nCould be done in a separate PR if that sounds reasonable, or in this PR if we risk having issues by sticking to an older version.\r\n*Edit:* Done, we can remove it if it causes issues.\r\n- [x] Update MoltenVK for official builds. WIP in https://github.com/godotengine/moltenvk-osxcross/pull/5.\r\n*Edit:* Done with https://github.com/godotengine/godot-build-scripts/pull/143.\r\n\r\nSupersedes #107773.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoteng